@@ -1 +1 @@
-<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#244e3c"><title>Changelog · RivSpotter</title><meta name="description" content="New features, improvements, and fixes to RivSpotter."><link rel="canonical" href="https://rivspotter.com/changelog.html"><meta property="og:title" content="Changelog · RivSpotter"><meta property="og:description" content="New features, improvements, and fixes to RivSpotter."><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:url" content="https://rivspotter.com/changelog.html"><meta property="og:site_name" content="RivSpotter"><meta property="og:image" content="https://rivspotter.com/assets/spotter-social-card.png"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="RivSpotter. Find your next stop. Your guide to Rivian places and charging."><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://rivspotter.com/assets/spotter-social-card.png"><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="RivSpotter. Find your next stop. Your guide to Rivian places and charging."><meta name="twitter:title" content="Changelog · RivSpotter"><meta name="twitter:description" content="New features, improvements, and fixes to RivSpotter."><link rel="icon" href="/assets/spotter-route-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=2026.45.2-270f5b1dd20f"><script defer src="/js/components.js?v=2026.45.2-270f5b1dd20f"></script><script src="https://tinylytics.app/embed/jj-9YE1ymyozj9wFfy7d.js" defer></script></head><body data-page=""><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="RivSpotter home"><img src="/assets/spotter-route.svg" width="36" height="36" alt=""><span>RIV<span class="brand-light">SPOTTER</span></span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Explore</a><a href="/saved.html">Saved</a><a href="/updates.html">Updates</a><a href="/about.html">About</a></nav></header><main id="main" class="page "><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Site changelog</p><h1>What’s new.</h1><p>New features, improvements, and fixes to RivSpotter.</p></header><div class="changelog"><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-15">Nov 15, 2026</time><span class="tag">Website</span></div><h2>Website improvements</h2><ul><li>Moved RivSpotter to AWS Amplify Hosting and CloudFront, creating a foundation for future features and improvements.</li><li>Updated caching and deployment workflows to help keep the website and app’s location data current.</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-06">Nov 6, 2026</time><span class="tag">2026.45.2</span></div><h2>Introducing RivSpotter</h2><ul><li>Our website and app have a new name: RivSpotter. Find the same map, location updates, and private visit journal at rivspotter.com.</li><li>Updated the branding, shared links, and daily email digest. Existing location links continue to work.</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><time datetime="2026-10-21">Oct 21, 2026</time><span class="tag">2026.43.1</span></div><h2>Follow changes across the map</h2><ul><li>Added a daily location update feed with new locations, coming-soon announcements, openings, and changes to charging and site details.</li><li>Search updates by location and filter by location type or kind of change.</li><li>Moved website release notes to Changelog, linked in the footer.</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><time datetime="2026-10-16">Oct 16, 2026</time><span class="tag">2026.42.26</span></div><h2>Charging locations and map improvements</h2><ul><li>Added Rivian’s announced future charging locations, including King City and Salinas, with Coming Soon labels and distinct map markers.</li><li>Added daily updates for coming-soon locations. City-level pins show approximate locations until station addresses are published.</li><li>Coming-soon locations now carry their saved places and page links forward when a matching active station is identified, adding published station and charging details automatically.</li><li>Light and dark appearance now follows your device automatically, with no separate theme switch.</li><li>Closing location details now zooms out to the surrounding region while keeping that location centered.</li><li>Combined Rivian Adventure Network and Waypoint stations at matching addresses into shared listings, with separate charger counts, speeds, and published rates for each network.</li><li>Made charging prices easier to read, with compact price ranges and expandable time-of-use schedules on location pop-ups and detail pages.</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><time datetime="2026-10-15">Oct 15, 2026</time><span class="tag">2026.42.21</span></div><h2>Charging data improvements</h2><ul><li>Expanded daily charging-detail checks to cover every Rivian Adventure Network site in the directory, including newly added locations.</li><li>Filled missing charger, pricing, and hours information for Jacksonville and East Greenwich.</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><time datetime="2026-10-14">Oct 14, 2026</time><span class="tag">2026.42.20</span></div><h2>October 2026 update</h2><ul><li>Added Rivian Adventure Network and Waypoint charging locations.</li><li>Redesigned the map and sidebar with separate Charging and Rivian Places views, location-type filters, and distinct map markers.</li><li>Added new Rivian locations and updated existing addresses, hours, and official links.</li><li>Added charging prices, connector types, speeds, site features, and individual charger details where available.</li><li>Added color-coded charging ratings to location cards and detail pages.</li><li>Added automatic location-data refreshes and dated charger maintenance and issue reports.</li><li>Introduced a new route-inspired logo across the site and app icons.</li><li>Improved mobile browsing with a fixed bottom List/Map bar that keeps location content unobstructed.</li><li>Added branded image previews for shared website and location links.</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><span class="tag">2026.06</span></div><h2>Search, directions, and mobile improvements</h2><ul><li>Added King of Prussia Space (opening Feb 21, 2026)</li><li>Updated Seattle University Village Space to open status</li><li>Added 8 new Service Centers: Long Island City NY, Iselin NJ, Martinez CA, Olathe KS, Hazelwood MO, Vaughan ON, Niagara Falls NY, Stallings NC</li><li>Removed 4 duplicate Service Center entries</li><li>Updated color palette to official Rivian brand colors (Launch Green, Rivian Blue)</li><li>Added address and zip code search via Mapbox geocoding</li><li>Added distance badges on location cards when user location is enabled</li><li>Added &quot;Get Directions&quot; button with platform-aware deep links (Apple Maps on iOS, Google Maps elsewhere)</li><li>Redesigned filter buttons as horizontal scrolling chips</li><li>Improved mobile experience with bottom sheet and swipe gestures</li><li>Added resource preloading for faster initial load</li><li>Added image optimization to build pipeline (WebP conversion)</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><span class="tag">2025.52</span></div><h2>Service Centers and improved location information</h2><ul><li>Added 34 Service Center locations from official Rivian data</li><li>Added direct links to Rivian.com for all locations</li><li>Implemented automatic dark/light mode based on system preference</li><li>Fixed mobile PWA layout and safe area spacing</li><li>Updated location hours from Rivian.com</li><li>Added La Jolla Space and San Jose Service Center</li><li>Updated README and About page with changelog</li><li>Fixed GitHub Actions deprecation errors</li><li>Added Service Centers count to stats</li></ul></article><article class="changelog-entry"><div class="changelog-meta"><span class="tag">2025.44</span></div><h2>Rivian Spotter launches</h2><ul><li>Initial launch with Spaces, Demo Centers, and Outposts</li><li>Interactive map with marker clustering</li><li>Search and filter by location type</li><li>Advanced filters (state, services, date range, distance)</li><li>Open Now / Coming Soon quick filters</li><li>Favorites and recent locations</li><li>Export to CSV/JSON</li><li>PWA support with offline caching</li><li>Statistics page</li><li>Mobile-responsive design</li></ul></article></div><footer class="site-footer"><span>Independent. Community maintained.</span><span><a href="/changelog.html">Changelog</a><a href="/contact.html">Report an update</a><a href="/about.html#sources">Sources</a><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a></span></footer></main><div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" hidden></div></body></html>
