 class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="RivSpotter home"><img src="/assets/spotter-app-mark.png" width="40" height="40" alt=""><span>RivSpotter</span></a><nav class="tab-bar" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/locations/"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="13" y="3" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="13" y="13" width="8" height="8" rx="2"/></svg><span>Locations</span></a><a href="/"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5.5 8 3v16l-6 2.5V5.5ZM9.5 3l5 2v16l-5-2V3ZM16 5l6-2.5v16L16 21V5Z"/></svg><span>Map</span></a><a href="/saved.html"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v19l-7-4.5L5 22V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z"/></svg><span>Saved</span></a><a href="/regions/" aria-current="page"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h10v2H7zM5 6h14v2H5z"/><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="12" rx="3"/></svg><span>Browse</span></a></nav><details class="more-menu"><summary aria-label="More"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="12" r=".7" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r=".7" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="12" r=".7" fill="currentColor"/></svg></summary><div class="more-list"><a href="/updates.html">Location updates</a><a href="/stats.html">Location data</a><a href="/changelog.html">Changelog</a><a href="/about.html">About</a><a href="/contact.html">Report an update</a></div></details></header><main id="main" class="page "><header class="page-header"><h1>About</h1><p>RivSpotter brings Rivian’s places into one useful map, so you can decide where to go and what to expect.</p></header><div class="content-grid"><section class="content-section"><h2>A place for every kind of visit.</h2><p>Explore Spaces to see the vehicles, find a location offering demo drives, check a service address, or make an Outpost part of a trip.</p><p>Each location page brings together its published address, contact details, hours, and official links. Filters use the capabilities confirmed by Rivian’s sources.</p><p><a href="/regions/">Browse the regional directory →</a></p></section><section class="content-section"><h2>Built for a useful next step.</h2><p>Save a shortlist, share an individual place, and get directions for your next visit. General opening hours and service hours remain separate.</p><p>RivSpotter is independently maintained and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Rivian Automotive. Rivian names and trademarks belong to their owners.</p></section></div><section id="sources" class="content-section"><h2>Information from Rivian.</h2><p>Location information comes from <a href="https://rivian.com/spaces/locations" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Rivian’s official location directory</a>, its location pages, its service-center map, and its <a href="https://rivian.com/experience/charging#map" target="_blank" rel="noopener">charging map</a>. Location pages include official links and the latest source refresh date.</p><p>Opening hours use the destination’s local time zone. Visiting, service, and charging hours are listed separately where published. Service visits and demo drives can be arranged directly with Rivian.</p><p>This directory includes Rivian Adventure Network and Waypoint charging locations from Rivian’s public charging map. Charger counts, published maximum power and access are shown on station pages. Map pins come from the official map; directions use the published station address when available. These are station details, not live charger availability. Charging details include pricing, connectors, location grades, and reported issues. Each snapshot has its own capture date. Charging information is refreshed daily. Announced future locations are labeled Coming Soon with approximate city pins; addresses and station details appear when published. Nearby charging and Rivian places link to each other without merging their services or hours.</p></section><section class="content-section"><h2>Privacy, in plain language.</h2><p>Saved places and theme preferences stay in your browser. “Near me” requests your location only when you tap it; coordinates are used locally to sort places and are not saved by RivSpotter. The map provider receives normal map requests for the area you view.</p><p>Maps are provided by Mapbox and its data partners. Their <a href="https://www.mapbox.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a> applies to map use. We use Tinylytics for site-usage analytics. We do not add advertising trackers. A service worker stores public pages and location data on your device for faster repeat visits and limited offline access.</p><p>Correction reports open an email draft in your own mail app. Nothing is sent until you send it.</p></section><section class="content-section"><h2>Help keep the map useful.</h2><p>A moved address, new opening, or changed schedule is worth sharing.</p><p><a class="button" href="/contact.html">Report an update</a></p></section><footer class="site-footer"><span>Independent and community maintained. Not affiliated with Rivian.</span><span><a href="/updates.html">Updates</a><a href="/stats.html">Location data</a><a href="/changelog.html">Changelog</a><a href="/about.html">About</a><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="/contact.html">Report an update</a></span></footer></main><div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" hidden></div></body></html>
